@startuml PersonaJourneys
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF8
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam defaultFontName "Plus Jakarta Sans"

title Peerly v2 — 4-Pillar Persona Interaction & Journey Flows

actor "Haripriya M.\n(Seeker / Marketing)" as Haripriya
actor "Jean R.\n(Idle Owner / Finance)" as Jean
actor "Meera K.\n(Finance Lead / Peer)" as Meera
actor "Rohan K.\n(Case Comp Lead)" as Rohan
actor "Thirupathi M.\n(Bulk-Reseller)" as Thiru

participant "Marketplace & Needs\n(Pillar: Things)" as Market
participant "Connect & Pairing\n(Pillar: Skills)" as Connect
participant "Community Board\n(Pillar: Help)" as Community
participant "Opportunities Radar\n(Pillar: Knowledge)" as Opps
participant "Trust & Accountability\nEngine" as Trust

== Journey 1: Things — Haripriya borrows a Navy Blazer for Case Finals ==
Haripriya -> Market : Searches "Blazer" on Browse tab
Market --> Haripriya : Displays Navy Blazer (Size 40/M) in Hostel 3
Haripriya -> Market : Opens item (#/item/l1) & taps "Request to Borrow"
Market -> Market : Simulates request acceptance (500ms)
Market --> Haripriya : "Request Accepted!" with Return-by Date ("Tomorrow, 6:00 PM")
Haripriya -> Market : Opens scripted chat drawer with Rohan
Haripriya -> Rohan : Coordinates lobby pickup at Hostel 3

== Journey 2: Things (Reverse Need) — Haripriya posts "Need Speaker" with Duplicate Nudge ==
Haripriya -> Market : Taps "Post a Need" -> Types "Bluetooth Speaker"
Market -> Market : Evaluates title against mockData inventory
Market --> Haripriya : Nudge Banner: "Good news — 2 batchmates already listed something similar!"
Haripriya -> Market : Confirms Need post with "Borrow Only" terms
Market --> Jean : Need appears in "Campus Needs" feed
Jean -> Market : Taps "I Have This"
Market --> Haripriya : Opens chat drawer with Jean to coordinate handoff

== Journey 3: Skills — Connect Hub, "People to Learn From" & Peer Pairing ==
Haripriya -> Connect : Opens Connect Hub (#/connect)
Connect -> Connect : Compares Haripriya's interests (Finance) against cohort skills
Connect --> Haripriya : "People to Learn From" card: "Meera K. can help with: Excel modeling, Valuation basics"
Haripriya -> Meera : Taps "Say Hi" -> Unlocks scripted peer chat
Haripriya -> Connect : Switches ON "Join Peer Pairing" toggle
Haripriya -> Connect : Taps "Simulate This Week's Pairing"
Connect --> Haripriya : Paired with Meera + Shared Icebreaker: "You both follow Consulting — discuss the Bain case!"

== Journey 4: Help — Community Board CaseComp Team-Up ==
Rohan -> Community : Posts 🤝 Team-Up: "Need 1 more for CaseComp Nationals (Marketing/GTM focus)"
Community --> Haripriya : Post rendered in Community Board feed
Haripriya -> Community : Taps "I'm Interested"
Community -> Community : Adds Haripriya's avatar to post interest roster & fires notification
Rohan -> Community : Views interested batchmates & taps "Message" to connect

== Journey 5: Knowledge — Personalized Opportunities Radar ==
Haripriya -> Opps : Opens Opportunities Radar (#/opportunities)
Opps -> Opps : Filters 15+ curated competitions against Haripriya's interests
Opps --> Haripriya : Displays "Recommended for You" (Bain Case Challenge, Swiggy APM, BCG)
Opps --> Haripriya : Highlights "Closing in 3 days" with animated amber urgency pill
Haripriya -> Opps : Taps "Customize My Radar Tags" to add "Venture Capital"
Opps -> Opps : Real-time re-filtering renders new recommendations instantly

== Journey 6: Things (Resale) — Thirupathi Sells Insulated Water Bottles ==
Thiru -> Market : Opens "+ Post an Item" (#/new-listing) -> Mode: "Sell", ₹299
Thiru -> Market : Switches ON "Listing multiple units / bulk inventory"
Market -> Trust : Checks ID verification status -> Confirms Verified Seller badge
Market --> Haripriya : Shows item with "Verified Seller Batch" badge
Haripriya -> Market : Taps "Buy for ₹299" -> Scripted handoff with UPI on delivery

== Journey 7: Trust & Closed-Loop Accountability ==
Haripriya -> Trust : Opens "My Peerly" (#/profile) -> Views active borrow countdown card
Haripriya -> Trust : Taps "Mark as Returned"
Trust --> Haripriya : Step 1: "Returned in good condition?" -> Selects "Yes, Perfect Condition"
Trust --> Haripriya : Step 2: "Rate peer interaction" -> Selects "👍 Smooth & Friendly!"
Trust -> Trust : Increments Rohan's rating (👍 19, 100%) & clears active borrow card

@enduml
